Mesa (PanVK Vulkan driver, libvulkan_panfrost.so)
==================================================

The bundled PanVK component (assets/panvk/panvk-kbase.zip) contains
libvulkan_panfrost.so, built from Mesa (https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa)
commit 5a07217f plus the panvk-kbase-android v26.3.1 patch series and patches
234-237 (tree commit 10a845b24cce8278838951dbc603fd9c6d8d9f8f; sources:
https://github.com/zolotvok/panvk-kbase-android, upstream
https://github.com/zenithblue-oss/panvk-kbase-android).

Mesa's core and drivers are licensed under the MIT license (LICENSE in this
folder, Mesa's licenses/MIT). Individual files carry their own SPDX identifiers;
the other licenses used by code that can be linked into the Vulkan driver are
included as LICENSE.Apache-2.0 and LICENSE.BSL-1.0. Mesa's docs/license.rst is
included as license.rst.

